,"target":{"mode":"bridge","ref":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/template/person.node-class.node","kind":"node-class","resourceKind":"node-class","scope":"focused-graph","grants":["create"],"key":"person","label":"Person"},"resourceKind":"node-class","scope":"focused-graph","grants":["create"],"bridge":{"ref":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/template/person.node-class.node","resourceKind":"node-class","scope":"focused-graph","grants":["create"]},"_classBinding":{"key":"person","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/template/person.node-class.node"},"_bridge":{"sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/template/person.node-class.node","entryPort":"root","kind":"node-class","targetKind":"node-class","classKey":"person","classRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/template/person.node-class.node"}}},{"id":"baron-coleman-detail","type":"port","label":"Baron Coleman","position":{"x":0,"y":-900},"width":720,"height":520,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"baron-coleman-person-graph","portId":"root","name":"Baron Coleman"},"view":{"intent":"node","payload":"node.web.summary","label":"Baron Coleman"},"renderShape":{"kind":"markdown"},"markdown":"# 👤 Baron Coleman\n\n![Portrait of Baron Coleman](https://image-cdn-ak.spotifycdn.com/image/ab6772ab00001692835251c375c695f38503e18c)\n\n**attorney · podcast host · political commentator**\n\nAmerican attorney in Montgomery, Alabama, and host of the Real Baron Podcast.\n\n*Episode artwork/photo: Real Baron Podcast on Spotify.*"}},{"id":"baron-coleman-person","type":"person","label":"Baron Coleman","position":{"x":0,"y":-300},"width":500,"height":340,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"displayName":"Baron Coleman","fullName":"George Baron Coleman","aliases":[],"summary":"American attorney in Montgomery, Alabama, and host of the Real Baron Podcast.","portrait":"https://image-cdn-ak.spotifycdn.com/image/ab6772ab00001692835251c375c695f38503e18c","birthDate":"","deathDate":"","pronouns":"","nationality":"American","primaryRoles":["attorney","podcast host","political commentator"],"canonicalUri":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/baron-coleman.node","status":"published","definitionKey":"person","_classBinding":{"key":"person","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/template/person.node-class.node"},"_bridge":{"classKey":"person","classRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/template/person.node-class.node","entryPort":"root","kind":"node-class","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/template/person.node-class.node","targetKind":"node-class"}}},{"id":"baron-coleman-section-1","type":"markdown","label":"Legal background","position":{"x":-900,"y":180},"width":700,"height":380,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"baron-coleman-person-graph"},"markdown":"## Legal background\n\nGeorge Baron Coleman is an attorney based in Montgomery, Alabama. Lawyers.com lists a J.D. from Indiana University School of Law in 2006, a B.S. from Faulkner University in 2002, and bar admissions in Alabama, Florida, and Tennessee. Listed practice areas include trial and appellate work, insurance and medical-malpractice defense, and criminal defense."}},{"id":"baron-coleman-section-2","type":"markdown","label":"Media and political work","position":{"x":0,"y":180},"width":700,"height":380,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"baron-coleman-person-graph"},"markdown":"## Media and political work\n\nColeman hosts the *Real Baron Podcast*, where he mixes legal analysis, politics, current events, and live commentary. His public professional profile also describes political-services work involving polling, campaign management, messaging, and grassroots organization."}},{"id":"baron-coleman-section-3","type":"markdown","label":"Recent visibility","position":{"x":900,"y":180},"width":700,"height":380,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"baron-coleman-person-graph"},"markdown":"## Recent visibility\n\nColeman's visibility expanded in the online commentary ecosystem around Candace Owens and the investigation and public controversy surrounding Charlie Kirk's death. In January 2026 he appeared for a long-form live episode of *Candace*, and his own podcast continued to discuss the same network of legal, political, and evidentiary questions."}},{"id":"baron-coleman-section-4","type":"markdown","label":"Lionel episode context","position":{"x":-450,"y":650},"width":700,"height":380,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"baron-coleman-person-graph"},"markdown":"## Lionel episode context\n\nIn Lionel Template v1 Example 01, Coleman appears both as a named actor and as a contributor in the Research Funnel. That placement reflects Lionel's description of distributed research and commentary. It does not independently validate the claims being circulated in that network."}},{"id":"baron-coleman-sources","type":"markdown","label":"Sources","position":{"x":0,"y":1150},"width":900,"height":520,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"baron-coleman-person-graph"},"markdown":"## Sources and photo provenance\n\n- **Lawyers.com / Martindale-Avvo**, *Mr. George Baron Coleman - Montgomery, AL Attorney*  \n  https://www.lawyers.com/montgomery/alabama/george-coleman-35435903-a/\n- **LinkedIn**, *Baron Coleman - ONE R, LLC*  \n  https://www.linkedin.com/in/baroncoleman\n- **Candace Owens / YouTube**, *Candace x Baron Coleman LIVE!! | Candace Ep 293*  \n  https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9naMwS0kMBE\n- **Spotify**, *Real Baron Podcast episode artwork*  \n  https://open.spotify.com/episode/4evqDgABrmwiA53D1qjCVY\n\n**Portrait URL:** https://image-cdn-ak.spotifycdn.com/image/ab6772ab00001692835251c375c695f38503e18c\n**Photo note:** Episode artwork/photo: Real Baron Podcast on Spotify.\n\n**Lionel context:** `github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/lionel/v1/example-01-associative-realignment.node`"}}],"edges":[{"id":"baron-coleman-section-edge-1","source":"baron-coleman-person","target":"baron-coleman-section-1","sourceHandle":"bottom","targetHandle":"top","type":"reference","label":"profile context"},{"id":"baron-coleman-section-edge-2","source":"baron-coleman-person","target":"baron-coleman-section-2","sourceHandle":"bottom","targetHandle":"top","type":"reference","label":"profile context"},{"id":"baron-coleman-section-edge-3","source":"baron-coleman-person","target":"baron-coleman-section-3","sourceHandle":"bottom","targetHandle":"top","type":"reference","label":"profile context"},{"id":"baron-coleman-section-edge-4","source":"baron-coleman-person","target":"baron-coleman-section-4","sourceHandle":"bottom","targetHandle":"top","type":"reference","label":"profile context"},{"id":"baron-coleman-class","source":"baron-coleman-declaration","target":"baron-coleman-person-bridge","sourceHandle":"root","targetHandle":"root","type":"reference","label":"class authority"},{"id":"baron-coleman-inst","source":"baron-coleman-person-bridge","target":"baron-coleman-person","sourceHandle":"root","targetHandle":"root","type":"reference","label":"instantiates"},{"id":"baron-coleman-